			"Message": "refactor(vine): Rename app_state field to AppState in AirVinegRPCService\n\nContinued the standardization of struct field naming conventions by renaming the `app `AppState` within the `AirVinegRPCService` implementation.\n\nThis change updates references across all service methods, including `DownloadFile`, `IndexFile`, `Status`, `DownloadUpdate`, `ApplyUpdate`, `DownloaderStream`, `GetMetrics`, `GetResourceUsage`, `SetResourceLimits`, `GetConfiguration`, and `UpdateConfiguration`. It also updates local variable bindings inside async closures where the state is cloned to ensure consistent usage throughout the module.",
