			"Message": "refactor(updates): Rename app_state field to AppState in UpdateManager\n\nRenamed the `app_state` struct field and associated variable references to `AppState` throughout the `UpdateManager` implementation.\n\nThis change updates the struct definition, the `new` constructor, the `Clone` implementation, and internal method calls (e.g., in `CheckForUpdates`, `FetchUpdateInfo`, and `BackgroundTask`) to use the capitalized identifier. This refactor improves consistency with the project's naming conventions without affecting runtime behavior.",
			"SHA": "2d76dafb7df617d309615b6db20ceff0d3084a1f"
		},
